  "note": "Election of nine members of Whitehead Urban District Council, poll due Wednesday 17 May 1967. Only eight nominations were received, so there was no election and the eight were returned unopposed; one seat remained to be filled by co-option. Eight nominations for nine seats, hence no election; the ninth seat was to be filled by co-option. Returned unopposed.",
